  "why": "The cats are quantised into the LODGE's 61-colour night palette (imported from gen_lodge_art, not re-declared here), because the cats walk through the lodge: one palette family, one pixel scale and one light direction across the building is the coherence rule in CLAUDE.md. The palette carries a cat ramp already (cat_dark/cat/cat_light = #b06a2a/#d98a3c/#eda95c, cat_cream = #f3d9b0), which is why all seven coats - including the calico's three-way white/orange/black and the siamese's cream body with dark points - can be expressed without adding a colour."
